sequenceDiagram
    participant CS as Charging Station (Test System)
    participant CSMS as CSMS (System under Test)

    Note over CS,CSMS: Prerequisite(s): n/a
    Note over CS,CSMS: Configuration State: N/a
    Note over CS,CSMS: Memory State: N/a
    Note over CS,CSMS: Execute Reusable State: EnergyTransferStarted

    Note over CS,CSMS: Manual Action: Request the CSMS to reboot the Charging Station with status Immediate

    CSMS->>CS: ResetRequest (type = Immediate)
    Note over CSMS: Validation: type must be Immediate,<br>evseId must be omitted
    CS-->>CSMS: ResetResponse (status = Accepted)

    CS->>CSMS: TransactionEventRequest (eventType = Ended, triggerReason = ResetCommand,<br>transactionInfo.chargingState = EVConnected,<br>transactionInfo.stoppedReason = ImmediateReset, idToken omitted)
    CSMS-->>CS: TransactionEventResponse

    CS->>CSMS: BootNotificationRequest (reason = RemoteReset)
    CSMS-->>CS: BootNotificationResponse
    Note over CSMS: Validation: status must be Accepted

    Note over CS,CSMS: The Test System notifies the CSMS about the current state of all connectors

    alt StatusNotificationRequest
        CS->>CSMS: StatusNotificationRequest (configured connectorId, connectorStatus = Occupied)
        CSMS-->>CS: StatusNotificationResponse
    else NotifyEventRequest
        CS->>CSMS: NotifyEventRequest (configured connectorId, trigger = Delta, actualValue = "Occupied",<br>component.name = "Connector", variable.name = "AvailabilityState")
        CSMS-->>CS: NotifyEventResponse
    end

    loop For each other connector
        alt StatusNotificationRequest
            CS->>CSMS: StatusNotificationRequest (connectorStatus = Available)
            CSMS-->>CS: StatusNotificationResponse
        else NotifyEventRequest
            CS->>CSMS: NotifyEventRequest (trigger = Delta, actualValue = "Available",<br>component.name = "Connector", variable.name = "AvailabilityState")
            CSMS-->>CS: NotifyEventResponse
        end
    end

    Note over CS,CSMS: Post scenario validations: N/a
